Z||000017||rogergarrison||03-02-2001||07:15 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Racer 1:<BR><B>Is the camaro and trans-am getting the axe also sometime soon?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I think I heard 2002 is last for camaro/firebird.<P>Im very happy with the handleing on my kit. 86SE, Bilstien struts, shocks. 205/60 frnt 225/60 rear on 8 1/2 rims. stock height, stock springs, no front or rear swaybar. The only times ive gotten loose was @65 in a 20mph curve, and that was because some other idiot slew some loose dirt and gravel on the side. Why mess with something that aint broke<P><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1234884&a=9116379&p=34556781"> ||||reg||1
